# Build context for every image (all Dockerfiles build from the repo root). The service images only COPY their
# prebuilt jar (<service>/target/<service>.jar); shop-ui copies shop-ui/ and builds it.
# Keeps local-only and secret files out of images and the context small.

# Local configuration and secrets (gitignored, but present in local working trees)
**/*-local.yml
.env*
**/.env*

# Build outputs and dependency caches, except the service jars the images copy
**/target
!*/target/*.jar
**/node_modules
**/.angular
**/dist
**/coverage

# VCS, tooling and IDE metadata
.git
.claude
.idea
**/.idea
*.iml
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
